1
00:00:06,337 --> 00:00:07,255
<c.simplifiedchinese>他能行！</c.simplifiedchinese>

2
00:00:07,338 --> 00:00:11,843
<c.simplifiedchinese>他轻而易举地接下了拔刀斋的一击…</c.simplifiedchinese>

3
00:00:11,926 --> 00:00:13,970
<c.simplifiedchinese>说不定他真的能…</c.simplifiedchinese>

4
00:00:14,053 --> 00:00:17,557
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是个傻瓜</c.simplifiedchinese>

5
00:00:18,307 --> 00:00:21,644
<c.simplifiedchinese>他一次都没有用斩马刀打中过</c.simplifiedchinese>

6
00:00:21,728 --> 00:00:25,189
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左根本没有胜算</c.simplifiedchinese>

7
00:00:25,273 --> 00:00:27,066
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？那…</c.simplifiedchinese>

8
00:00:27,150 --> 00:00:29,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>别担心 我自有办法</c.simplifiedchinese>

9
00:00:31,612 --> 00:00:35,241
<c.simplifiedchinese>事情终究像我计划的那样发展了</c.simplifiedchinese>

10
00:00:37,243 --> 00:00:41,622
<c.simplifiedchinese>拔刀斋先生
你确定真的要用这个架势吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

11
00:00:42,206 --> 00:00:45,209
<c.simplifiedchinese>你的攻击对我根本行不通的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

12
00:00:45,293 --> 00:00:47,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>不必担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

13
00:00:47,545 --> 00:00:51,424
<c.simplifiedchinese>比起这个 现在就是你收刀的好时机</c.simplifiedchinese>

14
00:00:53,468 --> 00:00:56,888
<c.simplifiedchinese>我还从没找到能收住这把刀的刀鞘</c.simplifiedchinese>

15
00:00:58,473 --> 00:01:02,060
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经开打的架可不能只打到一半</c.simplifiedchinese>

16
00:01:03,186 --> 00:01:06,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>打架第二幕 开场了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

17
00:01:23,164 --> 00:01:26,417
<c.simplifiedchinese>（原作：和月伸宏
集英社《周刊少年JUMP》）</c.simplifiedchinese>

18
00:03:01,053 --> 00:03:02,847
<c.simplifiedchinese>这个距离</c.simplifiedchinese>

19
00:03:05,141 --> 00:03:07,351
<c.simplifiedchinese>接招吧 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

20
00:03:07,977 --> 00:03:09,353
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

21
00:03:09,437 --> 00:03:11,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

22
00:03:22,783 --> 00:03:26,203
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左 如果单独的一击伤不了你</c.simplifiedchinese>

23
00:03:26,287 --> 00:03:27,413
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

24
00:03:29,081 --> 00:03:30,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>连击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

25
00:03:35,963 --> 00:03:36,964
<c.simplifiedchinese>太好了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

26
00:03:40,426 --> 00:03:41,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>好强…</c.simplifiedchinese>

27
00:03:42,178 --> 00:03:43,763
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流</c.simplifiedchinese>

28
00:03:44,263 --> 00:03:45,640
<c.simplifiedchinese>龙巢闪</c.simplifiedchinese>

29
00:03:45,723 --> 00:03:51,687
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀是巨大的重型武器
无论如何攻击招式都有限</c.simplifiedchinese>

30
00:03:52,188 --> 00:03:55,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>竖劈或者横砍 总是其中之一</c.simplifiedchinese>

31
00:03:57,193 --> 00:03:58,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>很容易看穿</c.simplifiedchinese>

32
00:03:59,695 --> 00:04:01,864
<c.simplifiedchinese>他不是只比我强一点</c.simplifiedchinese>

33
00:04:02,365 --> 00:04:04,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们根本不在一个等级</c.simplifiedchinese>

34
00:04:04,242 --> 00:04:06,994
<c.simplifiedchinese>没想到他竟然这么强！</c.simplifiedchinese>

35
00:04:08,204 --> 00:04:09,455
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不是他的对手…</c.simplifiedchinese>

36
00:04:09,956 --> 00:04:13,584
<c.simplifiedchinese>这不是第二幕 这是最后一幕了</c.simplifiedchinese>

37
00:04:14,961 --> 00:04:17,004
<c.simplifiedchinese>是时候结束这场无意义的战斗了</c.simplifiedchinese>

38
00:04:17,505 --> 00:04:21,676
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下不想再对你挥舞这把刀了</c.simplifiedchinese>

39
00:04:22,260 --> 00:04:24,679
<c.simplifiedchinese>老实接受你的失败吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

40
00:04:27,723 --> 00:04:28,891
<c.simplifiedchinese>相…</c.simplifiedchinese>

41
00:04:29,934 --> 00:04:32,853
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

42
00:04:35,898 --> 00:04:38,693
<c.simplifiedchinese>（十年前 东山道）</c.simplifiedchinese>

43
00:04:40,987 --> 00:04:42,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们是什么人？</c.simplifiedchinese>

44
00:04:42,488 --> 00:04:44,240
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们就是赤报队</c.simplifiedchinese>

45
00:04:44,323 --> 00:04:46,075
<c.simplifiedchinese>政府军的先头部队</c.simplifiedchinese>

46
00:04:46,575 --> 00:04:48,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们来北方做什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

47
00:04:48,536 --> 00:04:51,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们正在传播年贡半减令的消息</c.simplifiedchinese>

48
00:04:51,414 --> 00:04:55,876
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果维新军推倒幕府的统治
我们的税收就会减半</c.simplifiedchinese>

49
00:04:55,960 --> 00:04:58,421
<c.simplifiedchinese>那是好事啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

50
00:04:58,921 --> 00:05:04,135
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队是庆应四年 鸟羽伏见之战后</c.simplifiedchinese>

51
00:05:04,218 --> 00:05:08,306
<c.simplifiedchinese>由平民和在野人士组成的草莽部队</c.simplifiedchinese>

52
00:05:09,348 --> 00:05:13,269
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们在政府军
也就是维新军之前向江户进军</c.simplifiedchinese>

53
00:05:13,352 --> 00:05:19,692
<c.simplifiedchinese>调查沿途的同盟各藩 并争取支持</c.simplifiedchinese>

54
00:05:20,484 --> 00:05:24,113
<c.simplifiedchinese>第一分队由相乐总三带领</c.simplifiedchinese>

55
00:05:24,196 --> 00:05:25,906
<c.simplifiedchinese>由东山道向北进军</c.simplifiedchinese>

56
00:05:25,990 --> 00:05:31,120
<c.simplifiedchinese>传播维新政府的税收减半的公告</c.simplifiedchinese>

57
00:05:32,038 --> 00:05:33,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>过了这个村子就休息</c.simplifiedchinese>

58
00:05:33,998 --> 00:05:34,832
<c.simplifiedchinese>是</c.simplifiedchinese>

59
00:05:41,839 --> 00:05:44,133
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长！饭已经做好啦！</c.simplifiedchinese>

60
00:05:45,176 --> 00:05:47,386
<c.simplifiedchinese>你在干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

61
00:05:47,887 --> 00:05:48,804
<c.simplifiedchinese>你看</c.simplifiedchinese>

62
00:05:49,430 --> 00:05:50,473
<c.simplifiedchinese>那个吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

63
00:05:50,973 --> 00:05:52,266
<c.simplifiedchinese>普通的烟而已</c.simplifiedchinese>

64
00:05:52,767 --> 00:05:56,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>这说明他们有柴取暖 有食物果腹</c.simplifiedchinese>

65
00:05:57,396 --> 00:05:59,648
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不觉得很棒吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

66
00:05:59,732 --> 00:06:01,025
<c.simplifiedchinese>这…</c.simplifiedchinese>

67
00:06:01,108 --> 00:06:05,196
<c.simplifiedchinese>一路上我甚至见过没法生火的村子</c.simplifiedchinese>

68
00:06:07,907 --> 00:06:10,618
<c.simplifiedchinese>好好记住这一刻 左之助</c.simplifiedchinese>

69
00:06:11,535 --> 00:06:16,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>德川家三百年的统治即将结束
新时代即将来临</c.simplifiedchinese>

70
00:06:16,791 --> 00:06:20,961
<c.simplifiedchinese>弱者受人压迫
却只能哭泣的时代结束了</c.simplifiedchinese>

71
00:06:21,462 --> 00:06:25,216
<c.simplifiedchinese>没有高低之分
四民平等的时代来临了</c.simplifiedchinese>

72
00:06:26,217 --> 00:06:28,594
<c.simplifiedchinese>而我们赤报队将一马当先</c.simplifiedchinese>

73
00:06:28,677 --> 00:06:34,391
<c.simplifiedchinese>“可能要一年或十年才能实现目标
全都取决于我们如何为之努力”</c.simplifiedchinese>

74
00:06:34,475 --> 00:06:35,434
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

75
00:06:35,518 --> 00:06:38,145
<c.simplifiedchinese>你对我和克弘已经说了一千遍了</c.simplifiedchinese>

76
00:06:38,646 --> 00:06:39,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>是吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

77
00:06:39,772 --> 00:06:42,650
<c.simplifiedchinese>那赤报队的前途肯定是光明的</c.simplifiedchinese>

78
00:06:44,819 --> 00:06:45,653
<c.simplifiedchinese>喂 队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

79
00:06:46,320 --> 00:06:51,367
<c.simplifiedchinese>要是四民平等的新时代到来了</c.simplifiedchinese>

80
00:06:51,450 --> 00:06:55,204
<c.simplifiedchinese>我这样的农家子弟也能拥有姓氏吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

81
00:06:55,704 --> 00:06:56,747
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

82
00:06:56,831 --> 00:07:00,042
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我可以姓相乐吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

83
00:07:00,709 --> 00:07:03,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>“相乐左之助”…</c.simplifiedchinese>

84
00:07:03,337 --> 00:07:04,588
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错！</c.simplifiedchinese>

85
00:07:04,672 --> 00:07:08,008
<c.simplifiedchinese>不好 好奇怪的名字</c.simplifiedchinese>

86
00:07:08,092 --> 00:07:10,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>才不奇怪呢 超棒的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

87
00:07:11,512 --> 00:07:14,515
<c.simplifiedchinese>好吧 如果你喜欢的话就这样吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

88
00:07:15,975 --> 00:07:16,976
<c.simplifiedchinese>好！</c.simplifiedchinese>

89
00:07:18,936 --> 00:07:20,980
<c.simplifiedchinese>胡说什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

90
00:07:21,063 --> 00:07:23,399
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们赤报队是伪军？</c.simplifiedchinese>

91
00:07:23,482 --> 00:07:26,068
<c.simplifiedchinese>总督府已经向各藩部队下达了</c.simplifiedchinese>

92
00:07:26,152 --> 00:07:30,072
<c.simplifiedchinese>镇压“伪军赤报队”的命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

93
00:07:30,156 --> 00:07:33,451
<c.simplifiedchinese>我在碓冰垰的部队被剿灭了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

94
00:07:33,534 --> 00:07:34,702
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么会…</c.simplifiedchinese>

95
00:07:34,785 --> 00:07:36,620
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底为什么…</c.simplifiedchinese>

96
00:07:38,456 --> 00:07:40,166
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们被抛弃了</c.simplifiedchinese>

97
00:07:40,249 --> 00:07:44,336
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队一直传播的年贡半减令
成为了他们的阻碍！</c.simplifiedchinese>

98
00:07:44,420 --> 00:07:45,880
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么意思？</c.simplifiedchinese>

99
00:07:45,963 --> 00:07:51,427
<c.simplifiedchinese>他们答应税收减半
来赢得各藩农民的拥护</c.simplifiedchinese>

100
00:07:51,510 --> 00:07:54,513
<c.simplifiedchinese>财政困难的维新政府
却无法履行诺言</c.simplifiedchinese>

101
00:07:55,306 --> 00:08:01,020
<c.simplifiedchinese>于是他们就诬蔑赤报队是伪军
这样就不必兑现减税诺言了</c.simplifiedchinese>

102
00:08:01,103 --> 00:08:03,230
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐队长 我们怎么办？</c.simplifiedchinese>

103
00:08:03,314 --> 00:08:04,398
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

104
00:08:04,899 --> 00:08:07,234
<c.simplifiedchinese>我们不能违抗总督府的命令</c.simplifiedchinese>

105
00:08:07,818 --> 00:08:10,696
<c.simplifiedchinese>先去下泽的总部吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

106
00:08:11,280 --> 00:08:14,742
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助 克弘 你们留在这里</c.simplifiedchinese>

107
00:08:15,242 --> 00:08:16,869
<c.simplifiedchinese>为什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

108
00:08:17,369 --> 00:08:19,330
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们两个还小</c.simplifiedchinese>

109
00:08:19,413 --> 00:08:22,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>以后我不能再带你们上路了</c.simplifiedchinese>

110
00:08:22,124 --> 00:08:23,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

111
00:08:23,751 --> 00:08:24,752
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

112
00:08:26,086 --> 00:08:28,464
<c.simplifiedchinese>会没事的 别担心</c.simplifiedchinese>

113
00:08:29,256 --> 00:08:30,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>看家就拜托你们了</c.simplifiedchinese>

114
00:08:40,267 --> 00:08:41,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>相乐队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

115
00:08:49,527 --> 00:08:50,569
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助！</c.simplifiedchinese>

116
00:08:51,320 --> 00:08:52,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了 克弘？</c.simplifiedchinese>

117
00:08:55,157 --> 00:08:55,991
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长他…</c.simplifiedchinese>

118
00:08:59,745 --> 00:09:01,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>让一让！让我过去！</c.simplifiedchinese>

119
00:09:01,997 --> 00:09:04,458
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长！</c.simplifiedchinese>

120
00:09:06,460 --> 00:09:07,545
<c.simplifiedchinese>队长…</c.simplifiedchinese>

121
00:09:09,713 --> 00:09:14,343
<c.simplifiedchinese>伪军赤报队第一分队队长相乐总三</c.simplifiedchinese>

122
00:09:14,426 --> 00:09:16,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>四处散布税收减半的谣言</c.simplifiedchinese>

123
00:09:16,679 --> 00:09:20,349
<c.simplifiedchinese>欺骗民众 斩首示众…</c.simplifiedchinese>

124
00:09:20,432 --> 00:09:22,810
<c.simplifiedchinese>我真傻 信了他的鬼话</c.simplifiedchinese>

125
00:09:23,727 --> 00:09:26,397
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队真是群恶棍</c.simplifiedchinese>

126
00:09:30,442 --> 00:09:33,529
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的力量又恢复了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

127
00:09:34,530 --> 00:09:36,323
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不能输…</c.simplifiedchinese>

128
00:09:37,157 --> 00:09:40,035
<c.simplifiedchinese>我…不能…输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

129
00:09:43,831 --> 00:09:45,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>他站起来了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

130
00:09:45,499 --> 00:09:48,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>他的力量甚至比之前更强了</c.simplifiedchinese>

131
00:09:48,877 --> 00:09:50,879
<c.simplifiedchinese>让相乐队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

132
00:09:50,963 --> 00:09:53,674
<c.simplifiedchinese>和我们赤报队背负“恶”之一字</c.simplifiedchinese>

133
00:09:53,757 --> 00:09:58,304
<c.simplifiedchinese>还装作英雄的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

134
00:09:58,804 --> 00:10:01,098
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝对不能输给你！</c.simplifiedchinese>

135
00:10:01,181 --> 00:10:02,683
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队！</c.simplifiedchinese>

136
00:10:05,311 --> 00:10:06,604
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

137
00:10:08,439 --> 00:10:11,900
<c.simplifiedchinese>漂亮 干净利落的一击！</c.simplifiedchinese>

138
00:10:13,152 --> 00:10:15,946
<c.simplifiedchinese>被龙巢闪攻击后还有这么强的力量</c.simplifiedchinese>

139
00:10:16,030 --> 00:10:17,990
<c.simplifiedchinese>了不起的男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

140
00:10:21,327 --> 00:10:22,786
<c.simplifiedchinese>好 就是现在！</c.simplifiedchinese>

141
00:10:22,870 --> 00:10:25,205
<c.simplifiedchinese>去死吧 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

142
00:10:27,124 --> 00:10:28,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>不要！</c.simplifiedchinese>

143
00:10:31,795 --> 00:10:32,671
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

144
00:10:35,132 --> 00:10:35,966
<c.simplifiedchinese>大哥</c.simplifiedchinese>

145
00:10:36,050 --> 00:10:40,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的多重计谋总算成功了</c.simplifiedchinese>

146
00:10:40,554 --> 00:10:44,183
<c.simplifiedchinese>当我想到用枪的时候
你已经在劫难逃了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

147
00:10:50,397 --> 00:10:51,565
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

148
00:10:54,860 --> 00:10:56,945
<c.simplifiedchinese>他竟然看清了弹道</c.simplifiedchinese>

149
00:10:57,029 --> 00:10:59,239
<c.simplifiedchinese>用护手挡住了子弹？</c.simplifiedchinese>

150
00:10:59,990 --> 00:11:01,909
<c.simplifiedchinese>那么 这样又如何？</c.simplifiedchinese>

151
00:11:04,203 --> 00:11:07,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>伍兵卫 别让这群臭小子跑了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

152
00:11:07,331 --> 00:11:09,416
<c.simplifiedchinese>但我们没有绳子…</c.simplifiedchinese>

153
00:11:09,500 --> 00:11:10,834
<c.simplifiedchinese>那就打断他们的腿！</c.simplifiedchinese>

154
00:11:12,086 --> 00:11:13,045
<c.simplifiedchinese>说得也是</c.simplifiedchinese>

155
00:11:13,128 --> 00:11:14,296
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这混蛋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

156
00:11:14,380 --> 00:11:16,715
<c.simplifiedchinese>薰 你在那里发什么呆！</c.simplifiedchinese>

157
00:11:16,799 --> 00:11:17,716
<c.simplifiedchinese>赶紧跑啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

158
00:11:17,800 --> 00:11:18,967
<c.simplifiedchinese>不行…</c.simplifiedchinese>

159
00:11:19,051 --> 00:11:20,677
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的腿动不了了</c.simplifiedchinese>

160
00:11:20,761 --> 00:11:21,887
<c.simplifiedchinese>什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

161
00:11:21,970 --> 00:11:23,222
<c.simplifiedchinese>没办法了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

162
00:11:23,305 --> 00:11:25,140
<c.simplifiedchinese>你自己快点逃吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

163
00:11:25,224 --> 00:11:27,184
<c.simplifiedchinese>这里我会想办法的！</c.simplifiedchinese>

164
00:11:27,267 --> 00:11:29,103
<c.simplifiedchinese>你腿都不能动了 又有什么办法？</c.simplifiedchinese>

165
00:11:30,646 --> 00:11:32,064
<c.simplifiedchinese>挣扎吧！</c.simplifiedchinese>

166
00:11:37,736 --> 00:11:39,822
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说过吧？</c.simplifiedchinese>

167
00:11:39,905 --> 00:11:41,865
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是我自己要打的架</c.simplifiedchinese>

168
00:11:41,949 --> 00:11:44,118
<c.simplifiedchinese>绝不许任何人插手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

169
00:11:44,201 --> 00:11:45,077
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩…</c.simplifiedchinese>

170
00:11:45,160 --> 00:11:47,621
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不会输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

171
00:11:47,704 --> 00:11:50,040
<c.simplifiedchinese>我绝对不能输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

172
00:11:51,250 --> 00:11:52,251
<c.simplifiedchinese>喜兵卫</c.simplifiedchinese>

173
00:11:54,211 --> 00:11:56,380
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这个人真是无可救药了</c.simplifiedchinese>

174
00:11:56,463 --> 00:11:57,589
<c.simplifiedchinese>少废话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

175
00:12:01,760 --> 00:12:04,471
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下刻意压制了力道
让你不会晕过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

176
00:12:04,972 --> 00:12:07,599
<c.simplifiedchinese>暂时尝尝生不如死的痛苦吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

177
00:12:09,518 --> 00:12:14,523
<c.simplifiedchinese>“恶”这个字
应该由你这样的人背负…</c.simplifiedchinese>

178
00:12:15,023 --> 00:12:16,233
<c.simplifiedchinese>不</c.simplifiedchinese>

179
00:12:16,316 --> 00:12:18,902
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许应该由我们维新志士来背负</c.simplifiedchinese>

180
00:12:22,823 --> 00:12:24,408
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们做个了结吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

181
00:12:24,491 --> 00:12:25,325
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

182
00:12:26,034 --> 00:12:29,037
<c.simplifiedchinese>最强的维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

183
00:12:30,789 --> 00:12:31,748
<c.simplifiedchinese>好</c.simplifiedchinese>

184
00:12:32,541 --> 00:12:34,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>让我们了结这一切吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

185
00:12:35,961 --> 00:12:37,087
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心！</c.simplifiedchinese>

186
00:12:47,848 --> 00:12:50,726
<c.simplifiedchinese>来吧 拔刀斋！</c.simplifiedchinese>

187
00:12:52,811 --> 00:12:55,814
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是什么…他要干什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

188
00:12:55,898 --> 00:12:57,608
<c.simplifiedchinese>离心力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

189
00:12:57,691 --> 00:13:00,194
<c.simplifiedchinese>以他的恐怖力量和斩马刀的重量</c.simplifiedchinese>

190
00:13:00,277 --> 00:13:02,863
<c.simplifiedchinese>旋转起来他的攻击会更加有力！</c.simplifiedchinese>

191
00:13:05,157 --> 00:13:06,575
<c.simplifiedchinese>那天起</c.simplifiedchinese>

192
00:13:06,658 --> 00:13:11,038
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队被剿灭 我就日夜不停的打架</c.simplifiedchinese>

193
00:13:11,121 --> 00:13:15,751
<c.simplifiedchinese>只有打架的时候 我才能忘记一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

194
00:13:15,834 --> 00:13:19,213
<c.simplifiedchinese>而这十年间 我变强了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

195
00:13:19,296 --> 00:13:24,176
<c.simplifiedchinese>凭借这份强大
我要打倒你这最强的维新志士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

196
00:13:25,177 --> 00:13:29,139
<c.simplifiedchinese>你这种没出息的强大
是无法打倒在下的</c.simplifiedchinese>

197
00:13:47,574 --> 00:13:48,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是…</c.simplifiedchinese>

198
00:13:48,617 --> 00:13:50,577
<c.simplifiedchinese>这是他打败比留间的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

199
00:13:51,286 --> 00:13:54,414
<c.simplifiedchinese>飞天御剑流 龙槌闪</c.simplifiedchinese>

200
00:14:02,047 --> 00:14:03,882
<c.simplifiedchinese>你真是顽强啊</c.simplifiedchinese>

201
00:14:04,466 --> 00:14:09,429
<c.simplifiedchinese>受了龙槌闪没有倒下的人
你还是第一个</c.simplifiedchinese>

202
00:14:10,305 --> 00:14:13,725
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你应该快要站不住了吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

203
00:14:14,309 --> 00:14:16,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>在这里等 在下去找医生</c.simplifiedchinese>

204
00:14:17,271 --> 00:14:18,647
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没！</c.simplifiedchinese>

205
00:14:18,730 --> 00:14:20,440
<c.simplifiedchinese>还没结束呢！</c.simplifiedchinese>

206
00:14:20,524 --> 00:14:23,485
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没有倒下 我没有输！</c.simplifiedchinese>

207
00:14:23,569 --> 00:14:26,405
<c.simplifiedchinese>我以相乐和赤报队的名义发誓</c.simplifiedchinese>

208
00:14:26,488 --> 00:14:30,158
<c.simplifiedchinese>就算死也不会输给维新志士！</c.simplifiedchinese>

209
00:14:33,453 --> 00:14:35,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心…难道你要…</c.simplifiedchinese>

210
00:14:35,581 --> 00:14:37,833
<c.simplifiedchinese>这就对了 来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

211
00:14:37,916 --> 00:14:40,294
<c.simplifiedchinese>再来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

212
00:14:40,377 --> 00:14:41,295
<c.simplifiedchinese>快来！</c.simplifiedchinese>

213
00:14:41,879 --> 00:14:43,297
<c.simplifiedchinese>来啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

214
00:14:47,926 --> 00:14:50,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>你是不是找错打架的对手了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

215
00:14:51,138 --> 00:14:55,767
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队教导你的是去杀维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

216
00:14:55,851 --> 00:14:58,228
<c.simplifiedchinese>还是教导你去开启新时代？</c.simplifiedchinese>

217
00:14:58,312 --> 00:15:00,731
<c.simplifiedchinese>闭嘴！少来说教！</c.simplifiedchinese>

218
00:15:01,315 --> 00:15:04,651
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们维新志士口口声声说四民平等</c.simplifiedchinese>

219
00:15:04,735 --> 00:15:10,198
<c.simplifiedchinese>却沉迷利益 摆一副臭架子
捏造新时代的谎言还为之洋洋得意</c.simplifiedchinese>

220
00:15:10,282 --> 00:15:12,784
<c.simplifiedchinese>有什么资格说这种话！</c.simplifiedchinese>

221
00:15:12,868 --> 00:15:14,036
<c.simplifiedchinese>你错了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

222
00:15:14,786 --> 00:15:17,915
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心不是这种人</c.simplifiedchinese>

223
00:15:18,665 --> 00:15:21,335
<c.simplifiedchinese>他从不关心荣耀或权力</c.simplifiedchinese>

224
00:15:21,418 --> 00:15:24,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>他是用剑自由地保护大家的浪客</c.simplifiedchinese>

225
00:15:24,922 --> 00:15:28,050
<c.simplifiedchinese>你只知道他是刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

226
00:15:28,133 --> 00:15:31,595
<c.simplifiedchinese>少自说自话 突然过来找茬了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

227
00:15:31,678 --> 00:15:32,596
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错</c.simplifiedchinese>

228
00:15:32,679 --> 00:15:35,474
<c.simplifiedchinese>如果你还想接着打
就让我来当你的对手！</c.simplifiedchinese>

229
00:15:37,059 --> 00:15:40,520
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左 维新还没有结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

230
00:15:41,021 --> 00:15:42,522
<c.simplifiedchinese>当然</c.simplifiedchinese>

231
00:15:42,606 --> 00:15:47,986
<c.simplifiedchinese>表面上十年前维新就已经结束了
现在是明治时代了</c.simplifiedchinese>

232
00:15:48,695 --> 00:15:51,782
<c.simplifiedchinese>但那些真正需要幸福的人们</c.simplifiedchinese>

233
00:15:52,282 --> 00:15:55,953
<c.simplifiedchinese>仍然深陷在一个
弱者任人鱼肉的旧体制中</c.simplifiedchinese>

234
00:15:57,663 --> 00:15:58,914
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

235
00:15:58,997 --> 00:16:05,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>就是为了给这样的人提供一些帮助
才继续挥舞这把刀</c.simplifiedchinese>

236
00:16:06,755 --> 00:16:09,549
<c.simplifiedchinese>也许需要一年 也许需要十年</c.simplifiedchinese>

237
00:16:09,633 --> 00:16:13,220
<c.simplifiedchinese>也可能维新永远不会结束</c.simplifiedchinese>

238
00:16:13,971 --> 00:16:14,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>在下也不知道</c.simplifiedchinese>

239
00:16:15,347 --> 00:16:21,269
<c.simplifiedchinese>但这是向那些在明治维新中
牺牲的人补偿的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

240
00:16:22,729 --> 00:16:25,941
<c.simplifiedchinese>向那些在下作为刽子手拔刀斋</c.simplifiedchinese>

241
00:16:26,441 --> 00:16:30,362
<c.simplifiedchinese>杀害的人们赎罪的方式</c.simplifiedchinese>

242
00:16:40,706 --> 00:16:42,457
<c.simplifiedchinese>和他一样…</c.simplifiedchinese>

243
00:16:43,667 --> 00:16:46,378
<c.simplifiedchinese>梦想着真正的新时代并为之努力</c.simplifiedchinese>

244
00:16:46,461 --> 00:16:51,508
<c.simplifiedchinese>他和相乐队长一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

245
00:16:52,968 --> 00:16:57,055
<c.simplifiedchinese>而且他至今都在为之战斗</c.simplifiedchinese>

246
00:16:57,889 --> 00:17:01,476
<c.simplifiedchinese>我却陷入绝望 放弃了理想</c.simplifiedchinese>

247
00:17:02,102 --> 00:17:05,439
<c.simplifiedchinese>每天用打架麻痹自己 企图忘记一切</c.simplifiedchinese>

248
00:17:12,738 --> 00:17:15,407
<c.simplifiedchinese>对不起 相乐队长</c.simplifiedchinese>

249
00:17:16,491 --> 00:17:18,368
<c.simplifiedchinese>但是这个男人</c.simplifiedchinese>

250
00:17:19,953 --> 00:17:22,497
<c.simplifiedchinese>我完全输给他了</c.simplifiedchinese>

251
00:17:30,797 --> 00:17:33,842
<c.simplifiedchinese>我听说斩左的伤势很重</c.simplifiedchinese>

252
00:17:33,925 --> 00:17:36,303
<c.simplifiedchinese>全身是伤 大量出血</c.simplifiedchinese>

253
00:17:36,386 --> 00:17:40,307
<c.simplifiedchinese>想要保住一命 得住三个月院才行</c.simplifiedchinese>

254
00:17:40,807 --> 00:17:47,105
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左跟以前的敌人完全不在一个级别
在下也不好手下留情</c.simplifiedchinese>

255
00:17:47,189 --> 00:17:48,982
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯…</c.simplifiedchinese>

256
00:17:51,818 --> 00:17:53,320
<c.simplifiedchinese>怎么了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

257
00:17:53,820 --> 00:17:57,908
<c.simplifiedchinese>我说 别再这么沮丧了！</c.simplifiedchinese>

258
00:17:57,991 --> 00:18:00,160
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊…在下并没有…</c.simplifiedchinese>

259
00:18:00,243 --> 00:18:01,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

260
00:18:01,745 --> 00:18:04,831
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左昨天说的话或许有几分道理</c.simplifiedchinese>

261
00:18:04,915 --> 00:18:07,250
<c.simplifiedchinese>但你并不是那种维新志士</c.simplifiedchinese>

262
00:18:07,334 --> 00:18:11,129
<c.simplifiedchinese>通过昨天的战斗 斩左也一定了解了</c.simplifiedchinese>

263
00:18:12,047 --> 00:18:14,925
<c.simplifiedchinese>那家伙虽然挺傻的 但肯定明白了</c.simplifiedchinese>

264
00:18:15,008 --> 00:18:17,010
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以别再担心了</c.simplifiedchinese>

265
00:18:17,552 --> 00:18:19,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>谢谢你安慰在下</c.simplifiedchinese>

266
00:18:20,514 --> 00:18:21,348
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

267
00:18:21,431 --> 00:18:25,602
<c.simplifiedchinese>那我们转换下心情
痛快地吃一顿牛锅吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

268
00:18:25,685 --> 00:18:26,561
<c.simplifiedchinese>又吃？</c.simplifiedchinese>

269
00:18:28,313 --> 00:18:29,272
<c.simplifiedchinese>啊！</c.simplifiedchinese>

270
00:18:31,233 --> 00:18:34,111
<c.simplifiedchinese>咦？你们是前几天的…</c.simplifiedchinese>

271
00:18:34,194 --> 00:18:35,445
<c.simplifiedchinese>真是的</c.simplifiedchinese>

272
00:18:35,946 --> 00:18:38,949
<c.simplifiedchinese>我不介意被人挑衅</c.simplifiedchinese>

273
00:18:39,032 --> 00:18:42,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>但至少先练练再来吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

274
00:18:43,245 --> 00:18:44,454
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左！</c.simplifiedchinese>

275
00:18:45,163 --> 00:18:47,791
<c.simplifiedchinese>哟 昨天谢谢你照顾我啦</c.simplifiedchinese>

276
00:18:48,291 --> 00:18:49,376
<c.simplifiedchinese>你…</c.simplifiedchinese>

277
00:18:49,459 --> 00:18:51,670
<c.simplifiedchinese>已经能自由活动了？</c.simplifiedchinese>

278
00:18:52,629 --> 00:18:55,215
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的优点就是耐打</c.simplifiedchinese>

279
00:18:55,298 --> 00:18:57,134
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

280
00:18:59,719 --> 00:19:00,846
<c.simplifiedchinese>-戳
-戳</c.simplifiedchinese>

281
00:19:00,929 --> 00:19:02,013
<c.simplifiedchinese>戳</c.simplifiedchinese>

282
00:19:03,890 --> 00:19:06,560
<c.simplifiedchinese>我的优点就是耐打</c.simplifiedchinese>

283
00:19:06,643 --> 00:19:08,770
<c.simplifiedchinese>这点伤不算什么</c.simplifiedchinese>

284
00:19:08,854 --> 00:19:11,606
<c.simplifiedchinese>没错 他在逞强</c.simplifiedchinese>

285
00:19:12,941 --> 00:19:13,775
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩左</c.simplifiedchinese>

286
00:19:13,859 --> 00:19:17,237
<c.simplifiedchinese>你不准备摘掉背上的“恶”字吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

287
00:19:17,320 --> 00:19:18,446
<c.simplifiedchinese>嗯</c.simplifiedchinese>

288
00:19:18,530 --> 00:19:22,534
<c.simplifiedchinese>赤报队是我不能忘记的过去</c.simplifiedchinese>

289
00:19:23,034 --> 00:19:24,452
<c.simplifiedchinese>我没法摘下这个字</c.simplifiedchinese>

290
00:19:25,328 --> 00:19:30,500
<c.simplifiedchinese>我都19岁了
现在想改变我恶劣的性格也太晚了</c.simplifiedchinese>

291
00:19:31,001 --> 00:19:35,630
<c.simplifiedchinese>我也在想
你昨天的话嘴上说说倒是容易</c.simplifiedchinese>

292
00:19:36,923 --> 00:19:37,841
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以</c.simplifiedchinese>

293
00:19:37,924 --> 00:19:42,179
<c.simplifiedchinese>你跟那些满口空话的维新志士
到底哪里不一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

294
00:19:42,679 --> 00:19:46,141
<c.simplifiedchinese>今后我会一直缠在你身边亲眼见证的</c.simplifiedchinese>

295
00:19:47,684 --> 00:19:49,603
<c.simplifiedchinese>还有一件事</c.simplifiedchinese>

296
00:19:49,686 --> 00:19:51,813
<c.simplifiedchinese>我已经不再是斩左了</c.simplifiedchinese>

297
00:19:51,897 --> 00:19:54,566
<c.simplifiedchinese>斩马刀断了 我也不再做打手了</c.simplifiedchinese>

298
00:19:55,150 --> 00:19:58,737
<c.simplifiedchinese>现在我是相乐左之助
一个热爱打架的人</c.simplifiedchinese>

299
00:19:59,237 --> 00:20:03,033
<c.simplifiedchinese>就像你不再是刽子手拔刀斋一样</c.simplifiedchinese>

300
00:20:05,076 --> 00:20:11,041
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 没有我的允许
可别偷偷去流浪啊 剑心</c.simplifiedchinese>

301
00:20:12,042 --> 00:20:13,084
<c.simplifiedchinese>哎呀呀</c.simplifiedchinese>

302
00:20:14,044 --> 00:20:16,254
<c.simplifiedchinese>又一个奇怪的伙伴加入了队伍</c.simplifiedchinese>

303
00:20:16,338 --> 00:20:17,214
<c.simplifiedchinese>（恶）</c.simplifiedchinese>

304
00:20:17,297 --> 00:20:19,090
<c.simplifiedchinese>（红牛牛锅）</c.simplifiedchinese>

305
00:20:19,174 --> 00:20:20,175
<c.simplifiedchinese>妙小姐？</c.simplifiedchinese>

306
00:20:20,842 --> 00:20:23,637
<c.simplifiedchinese>左之助先生他又没付钱…</c.simplifiedchinese>

307
00:20:23,720 --> 00:20:25,347
<c.simplifiedchinese>哦啰</c.simplifiedchinese>

308
00:22:07,782 --> 00:22:09,617
<c.simplifiedchinese>求…求你了</c.simplifiedchinese>

309
00:22:09,701 --> 00:22:11,661
<c.simplifiedchinese>你要多少钱我都给你</c.simplifiedchinese>

310
00:22:11,745 --> 00:22:14,247
<c.simplifiedchinese>所以 求求你饶我一命…</c.simplifiedchinese>

311
00:22:15,415 --> 00:22:20,462
<c.simplifiedchinese>你们维新志士都让钱给迷昏头了吗？</c.simplifiedchinese>

312
00:22:25,717 --> 00:22:27,385
<c.simplifiedchinese>什…这是什么？</c.simplifiedchinese>

313
00:22:27,469 --> 00:22:29,262
<c.simplifiedchinese>我全身都动不了了</c.simplifiedchinese>

314
00:22:29,345 --> 00:22:30,680
<c.simplifiedchinese>到底怎么回事？</c.simplifiedchinese>

315
00:22:36,102 --> 00:22:38,688
<c.simplifiedchinese>死吧</c.simplifiedchinese>

316
00:22:46,946 --> 00:22:49,574
<c.simplifiedchinese>下一回 《黑笠》</c.simplifiedchinese>

